WEBVTT

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.190
Satoshi, who dreams of
becoming a Pokémon Master...

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:10.900
And Go, who has found his goal of
catching every Pokémon to work his way towards Mew.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.360
A fun and exciting life with Pokémon
awaits these two again today!

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.390
Slowly... Slowly...

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.730
Why am I doing this?

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.560
It's good for your health,
so why not?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.900
Kung-fu exercises with everyone,
first thing in the morning!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.360
Geez...

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.360
This is pretty tough.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.370
How is Barrierd so steady?

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.200
It must have a fit torso.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.500
Hibunny.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.170
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.840
L-Like this?

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.640
What? Like <i>that</i>?

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.770
That's supposed to
be an example?

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.440
No, I'm sure this is...

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.240
I just heard a weird noise.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:40.530
Wait, aren't Transel's insides...

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.950
A-A-A-Are you okay?!

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.330
Dad, calm down!
That's a rock!

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.120
Transel, are you hurt?!

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.380
What a relief.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.420
Go!

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.550
Let's go to the Hoenn Region!

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.730
What?

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.480
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.070
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.780
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.660
And skip the slow send-off

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.990
Be it through fire or through water

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.660
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:29.170
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:34.420
Each and every one of my memories

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:39.010
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.930
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:48.690
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:55.690
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:59.900
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.240
Let's have a fight!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.950
1: Once the battle's done

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.790
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:10.120
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:16.800
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:22.140
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.640
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:28.770
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.480
I choose you!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:39.490
Face the Battle Frontier!!
Fierce Battles in the Hoenn Region!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.490
Battle Frontier, Hoenn Region

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.400
The Battle Frontier
Glass Flute Cup!
Battle Frontier, Hoenn Region

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.370
A place of fierce battles
and strong battlers!
Battle Frontier, Hoenn Region

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.950
Bring two Pokémon and win your way
up the ranks in Single Battles!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.830
The winner gets this set of
five colored Glass Flutes!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:05.300
Come join the Battle Frontier Glass Flute Cup,
and let's have some Pokémon battles!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.560
I see.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.640
And?

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.230
Who did you enter?

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.480
Pikachu and...

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.650
...Barrierd!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.990
Barrierd, huh?

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.080
Wait, <i>Barrierd?!</i>

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.120
Can it even battle?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.420
What's with that bizarre smile?!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.670
"Putting that aside..."

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.880
No, I <i>can't</i> put it aside!
I'm worried!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.590
Who did you enter, then?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.220
I'm going with Hibunny and...

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.680
Who'd be the best at battling here...?

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.020
Kaiross! You!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.990
You want to go, Strike?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:14.290
Strike, huh?
This is gonna be loads of fun!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.080
I'm really getting fired up!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.250
You really love
Pokémon battles, don't you?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.170
Yeah! It's hard to explain,

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:28.260
but I kinda feel like I can do anything
when I'm with my Pokémon!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.010
What about you?

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:34.270
Well... I'm not really sure yet.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.690
There you go,
saying stuff like that again...

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.850
You came with me, didn't you?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.860
Only because <i>you</i> signed me up
without asking!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.110
Besides...

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.410
A Pokémon?!
Let's get it, Hibunny!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.580
Gonna catch ourselves
some Hoenn Pokémon!

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.830
I see...

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.210
It's Hariteyama!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.760
Is it participating, too?

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:08.550
Hariteyama. Arm Thrust Pokémon.
Fighting type.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:13.260
They love to compare their freakish strength—
strength enough to send a truck flying with a single slap.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.990
What?! A battle already?!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.330
I won't lose, then!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.190
Hey, you.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.450
Yeah?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.380
Could you move?

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.050
Sorry!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.380
Don't sweat it.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.600
Y-You all right?!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:02.350
Yeah... I'm f-fine...

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.480
That didn't hurt! Not at all!

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:16.490
Monster Ball, go!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.700
Excellent!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:30.720
Subame's data will be
added to the Index!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.630
All right!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:36.930
Subame feeds on Kemusso
that live in forests.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.020
Which means...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.860
If we follow it,
we might meet Kemusso!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.620
What's this?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.430
I'm Satoshi.
This is my partner, Pikachu.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.010
And this is Barrierd.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.760
I'm Hoji from Fuen Town.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.230
And this is Hariteyama.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.020
Does that mean you signed up
with Hariteyama?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.110
Sure did.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.230
And who else?

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.070
I can't tell you.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.700
Can't show my hand to
a guy I might end up batt-

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:38.780
Graena!

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.540
Go!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.960
Prepare yourself, Graena!
I'll catch you this time, for sure!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.540
Hold it!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.670
This is <i>my</i> Pokémon!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.340
So your other Pokémon is Graena!

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.100
Darn it... And here I thought
I'd get to catch a Graena,

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.220
but it belonged to this guy...

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.560
Not "this guy!" Name's Hoji!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.190
Anyway, check this out, Satoshi!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.860
You caught yourself a Subame, Go?

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.480
Of course I did!

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.570
And I'm gonna keep catching
tons of more stuff!

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.450
Well, aren't you cute?

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.450
Are you making fun of me?!

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:22.790
No I'm not.
I just think your sincerity is cute.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.210
You <i>are</i> making fun of me!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.580
Why me?!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.210
Me again?!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.520
Those two are great friends, huh?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.640
Yeah...

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.650
Oh, I got the tournament brackets.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.200
Lemme see!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:56.950
I see... My first opponent
is this guy, huh?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.200
Not "this guy"! My name is Go!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.700
I won't lose!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:11.710
The Battle Frontier Glass Flute Cup
is finally starting!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:19.470
The first battle is Go from Kuchiba City
VS Hoji from Fuen Town!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.050
Go! Hoji!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.850
Give us a good battle!

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.140
S-Sure...

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.850
Now, who will they send out first?!

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:31.860
C'mon!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.700
Amazing...

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.330
It's got a totally different vibe
from before.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:56.340
Evil types are weak to Bug types.
Strike has the advantage!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:00.130
We can win this match!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.760
But we'd better play it safe!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.640
Let the match begin!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.140
Boost your attack power!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.140
Strike! Swords Dance!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.570
Fire Fang!

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:26.790
Oh, my! Strike was
caught off guard!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.660
It's super effective!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:32.040
Strike is unable to battle!
Graena wins!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:35.130
Sorry! My plan was bad.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.040
So sorry...

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.860
You're right! We just gotta
win the next match!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.610
Now Contestant Go
sends out Hibunny!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.450
Let's put some pressure
on them, Hibunny!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.580
Use Double Kick!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.710
Bark Out!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.710
Now, Graena! Crunch!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.710
Hibunny?!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:30.560
Hibunny is unable to battle!
As such, the winner is Contestant Hoji!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.440
Contestant Hoji is strong!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.480
He advanced to the second round
in an instant!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.480
Well done, Graena!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.030
Hibunny...

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.290
Go...

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.300
Pocket Monsters.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:09.470
Evil
Graena

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.520
We've restored your Pokémon
to full health.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.980
Thank you.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.280
Hibunny... Strike...

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.910
Go, cheer up.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.710
Catching is better after all.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.580
I'm gonna go looking for Kemusso!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:39.630
Go!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:43.420
Watch our battles, okay?

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.470
Come on, Hibunny, Strike!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:58.190
Amazing! Satoshi from Masara Town and Pikachu
demonstrate remarkable strength!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.690
Overwhelming strength!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:05.530
Hoji from Fuen Town
has no equal!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:11.580
The Battle Frontier Glass Flute Cup
has reached the finals at last!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:17.250
It comes down to a battle between
Satoshi from Masara Town and Hoji from Fuen Town!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.210
I made it!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.090
You're up!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.760
What?! Barrierd?!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.480
There's no way...
It couldn't possibly beat that thing!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.480
Let the match begin!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.730
Get 'em, Hariteyama!
Use Force Palm!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.360
Oh, no!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.620
Dodge it, Barrierd!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.870
They managed to dodge it!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.620
Keep using Force Palm!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:04.710
Amazing! Hariteyama keeps launching powerful shockwaves,
but Barrierd is dodging them all!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.340
Good! Keep it up!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:13.140
It sways from side to side, seemingly about to fall
yet standing strong! Such mysterious movements!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.850
Are these its kung-fu exercises?

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.480
Will you <i>stand still?!</i>

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.320
Now, Barrierd! Focus Punch!

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:30.650
All right!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.790
Barrierd can battle like that?!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.670
Don't stop! Use Arm Thrust!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.790
Reflector!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:48.250
Barrierd guards itself against
Hariteyama's Arm Thrust!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.630
We're not done...
Arm Thrust!

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:50.510
Reflector!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:52.760
Arm Thrust!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.770
Reflector!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.390
Arm Thrust!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.270
When did it...?!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:10.280
A-Amazing! Hariteyama has been
locked in place by Barrierd's Reflectors!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.490
We'll finish it now, Barrierd!
Psychokinesis!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.460
Hariteyama?!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.590
Yeah!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:36.030
Hariteyama is unable to battle!
Barrierd wins!

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.490
All right! You did it, Barrierd!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.980
Strong! So strong!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.490
I have gained a newfound
respect for Barrierd!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.450
You fought well, Hariteyama.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.340
Graena's up next!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.460
Let's do this, Barrierd!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:21.100
Oh, my! Barrierd seems to have
lost the will to fight!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.640
Got it!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.980
Then you can take a nice, long rest!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.270
You're up, Pikachu!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.400
He switches to Pikachu!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.280
Use Bark Out!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.450
Lightning Speed!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.410
Keep going! Iron Tail!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.830
Graena, use Crunch!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.930
Don't let them scare you, Pikachu!
Hit them with 100,000 Volts!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.440
Don't let 'em, Graena!
Bark Out!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.020
W-What a battle!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.860
A breathtaking exchange of moves!

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.650
The two have truly earned
their spot in the finals!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:19.780
You can't even blink!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.080
This is...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.790
This is a Pokémon battle?!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.620
You all right, Pikachu?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.750
Let's finish this!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.540
Graena, use Sneak Attack!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:42.100
Oh, my! There's no knowing
where the attack will come from now!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.850
What will you do, Satoshi?

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.940
Now! Get him, Graena!

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:52.650
All right!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:53.860
We're not done, Pikachu!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.900
Send an Electroweb upwards!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.110
What is Pikachu doing?!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.870
It launched an Electroweb
in entirely the wrong direction!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.620
What?!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.460
Now use Iron Tail!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.130
Dodge it, Graena!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.350
Graena is unable to battle!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.100
Pikachu wins!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.770
U-Unbelievable!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:33.860
Satoshi and Pikachu used the force
of Graena's attacks against it!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:38.860
Contestant Satoshi achieves
an unquestionable victory!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.660
You did it, Pikachu!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:54.540
The winner of the Battle Frontier Glass Flute Cup
is Satoshi from Masara Town!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.170
Thank you very much!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.480
Satoshi.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:22.070
That was the best battle
I've ever had!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.410
Yeah, it really was fun!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.920
Congratulations on winning,
Satoshi, Pikachu!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.590
Thanks!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.670
Barrierd, you were really cool, too!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.180
Oh, and...

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:45.720
Um...

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.060
Pokémon battles...

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.310
...sure are fun, huh?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.360
Yeah!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.570
What's the deal with these Kemusso?

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:06.200
Go caught them in
the Hoenn Region!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.410
But why are there three?

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:14.280
You never know if Kemusso will evolve
into Karasalis or into Mayuld, you know!

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:16.710
Looks like they're evolving!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.040
What?! Already?!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.210
Just kidding!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.180
Ow!

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.180
You deserved that one.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.350
Nice kick!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.260
Experiencing plenty of
different battles,

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:34.930
Satoshi and Go have once more seen
how fun life with Pokémon can be!

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:39.860
Tomorrow, more dreams and adventures await
in the world of Pocket Monsters!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.610
Let's go!

